          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "опрос (oprós) — \"a survey, a poll\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "После опроса все узнали мнение студентов. Pósle oprósa vse uználi mnéniye studéntov. After the survey everyone learned what the students thought."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Опрос общественного мнения — an opinion poll."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "опрос (oprós) is built on о- and просить \"to ask\", which is inherited from Proto-Slavic prositi, from PIE preḱ- \"to ask\" (EtymDB): asking round."
            }
          ]
        },
