          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "EtymDB derives редактор (redáktor) from French rédacteur \"editor\", given a Latin-style ending -ор; the French word is built on Latin redāctus, the participle of redigere \"to drive back, to bring back\" (Lewis & Short)."
